## Currently Supported

FOSSBilling currently supports these server managers:

- [CWP](/admin-guide/server-managers/cwp/)
- Plesk
- DirectAdmin
- [HestiaCP](/admin-guide/server-managers/hestiacp/)
- [WHM/cPanel](/admin-guide/server-managers/whm/)

## Our Stance on New Server Managers

Right now, the project is focused on stability and improving the core hosting workflows before adding more first-party integrations.

Want to help? Check out our guide on [creating a server manager](/extensions-and-development/guides/creating-a-server-manager/).

## Frequently Requested

See [this GitHub issue](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/issues/1362) for a list of server managers the community has requested.

## Not Planned: Pterodactyl

FOSSBilling does not support Pterodactyl, and the core project does not plan to build or maintain an integration. It is a common request, but the team needs to keep its limited time focused on core billing and hosting functionality.
